OL,3,AProbation officers to take industrial
OL,4,Aaction over pay and early release
OL,5,Ascheme
OL,6,
OL,7,FProbation officers have voted to reject
OL,8,Fa 5% pay rise and take industrial
OL,9,Faction, citing growing pressure created
OL,10,Fby the government's prisoner early
OL,11,Frelease scheme.
OL,13,FMembers of Napo, the probation service
OL,14,Funion, voted to refuse overtime from 23
OL,15,FNovember - and could take strike action
OL,16,Fshould the union "deem that option to
OL,17,Fbe necessary".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
