OL,3,AProbation officers to take industrial
OL,4,Aaction over pay and early release
OL,5,Ascheme
OL,6,
OL,7,FIts general secretary Ian Lawrence said
OL,8,Fthe service was "already in crisis"
OL,9,Fbefore the early release scheme came
OL,10,Finto force, which relies on probation
OL,11,Fstaff monitoring freed prisoners in the
OL,12,Fcommunity.
OL,14,FA Ministry of Justice spokesperson said
OL,15,Fthe government had put forward a
OL,16,F"strong offer" and was recruiting an
OL,17,Fextra "1,300 officers to significantly
OL,18,Fcut workloads".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
