OL,3,A'Miracle on Mississippi' - All
OL,4,Apassengers rescued after New Orleans
OL,5,Acruise ship collision
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome 130 people on a cruise ship docked
OL,8,Fin New Orleans have been rescued after
OL,9,Fit was struck by a tanker.
OL,11,FThe cruise ship, American Heritage, was
OL,12,Fleft lying on its side in the
OL,13,FMississippi River after it was hit by
OL,14,Fthe cargo vessel, Atlantic Asphalt.
OL,16,FThe collision left 32 people from the
OL,17,Fstricken riverboat in hospital with
OL,18,Fnon-critical injuries, but no-one
OL,19,Funaccounted for. Officials hailed it as
OL,20,Fa "miracle on the Mississippi".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
